# Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create (or pick) a Google Cloud project
#   2. APIs & Services -> Library -> enable "Maps JavaScript API"
#   3. APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create Credentials -> API key
#   4. Restrict the key to "Maps JavaScript API" and to your dev origin (localhost)
#   5. A billing account must be attached to the project, even for free-tier usage
#      (Google requires this; a healthy free monthly credit covers normal dev use)
#
# Then copy this file to .env and paste your key below.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
